&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1216ff7750a7055067a44fccc35d0d5 3x"}, "body": "Hello, thank you for the appeal ^^\n\nI'm glad you've taken interest in my OC, Kirani, and I would love an artwork of her in your style\n\nShe's a young woman who is able to control living plants and became the queen of the forest\n\nHer personality is vengeful, have difficulties in trusting others, yet still kind to those close to her\n\nShe become like this after her childhood friend betrayed her by burning down her forest\n\nOther details:\n- She have fireflies that follows her around and guides her\n\nYou can draw her however you like in whatever pose you want\n\nThank you for your time ^^\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GFBq-x7exAlCNipgsk1ZmXNqZXEgRM1r", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muromachi/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2824027, "client_id": 2976369, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3193b62e30c6cf048045e6847110a80c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3193b62e30c6cf048045e6847110a80c, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57548e701308288b050d7a1af7d2ad2e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53d2643ca0f398a2abb96f7dd45702d1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=662d3e88a6d7f08bfd036cee3ff59df8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=662d3e88a6d7f08bfd036cee3ff59df8, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3d1dae176cb86696ba0ed19721638150 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7fddadc86ed4e9fdf8685925f8027dd 3x"}, "body": "Thank you so much for the appeal!! Your art style is stunning! I checked your art on your socials and I'd be honored if you drew my original character, Dorian, like you mentioned. ^^\n\nYou may draw him however you like, I'll leave the details and composition up to you! I'd love to see what you come up with. \n\nIf it helps his height is 180.34 cm and he is 25 years old. Recurring motifs for him are eyes and crosses. \n\nThank you again for your appeal and for your consideration ! ♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/160vDHWEvPc0OlhzxKg85HOMFT5RB_C3S", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muromachi/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2824027, "client_id": 1150684, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69867e903444ea66ff0b245abb81cd6f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69867e903444ea66ff0b245abb81cd6f, https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=329dee5989865f166910d1537ee2c53b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5097af5eead53a205263bec9fdd6ff91 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=630d4de90d259711a02ca80b9f8e9720", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=630d4de90d259711a02ca80b9f8e9720, https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cb8c776781e83efc891dc679cdf7e23a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed30f1ad3eef23782b6128bcb3e11bd7 3x"}, "body": "Hello Muromachiさん, nice to meet you! \n\nThank you for your appeal😸. Your profile artworks look amazing!\n\nI am excited to have you draw a full-body illustration of Ansron with your Retenta fashion design. I will leave it up to you for the best way to showcase Ansron’s charm 😄.\n\nPlease feel free to use any artwork in my profile as reference. Or this might be helpful:\nhttps://x.com/ansronl/status/1490112899930492929?s=46&t=YmbwFt9HNn_nvThRElyTbA\n\nThank you again and looking forward to your great art!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muromachi/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2824027, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7487bd095f9944ef4a3172a7bd7f0b5f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7487bd095f9944ef4a3172a7bd7f0b5f, https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9604bb79da5826939c27fa8b0e0913b0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e5e6bae85e6f21efcd57ffb7820af45 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc21f22bc2572afeb1d2172696a2c5c3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc21f22bc2572afeb1d2172696a2c5c3, https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=577f555565bae1ed9aac63c1305ac2b3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b343fe59/uploads/origins/b605e406-427c-443c-8273-49ec0fd87ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9b9739f9194ea76868b93053d757934 3x"}, "body": "アピールをありがとう。以前からあなたの絵を見ていましたが、リクエストを受け付けているとは知りませんでした。\n私のOCを描いていただけませんか？\n\n特徴\n-見た目24歳\n-髪は少しオレンジがかったサンドブラウン。\n-髪の長さは鼻の下くらい。\n-ティール色の目。\n-イヤリングは2つ、1つは銅にはめ込まれたアメジスト、もう1つはすべて銅。\n-サテンの白いアンダーシャツ、長袖。\n-アンダーシャツの襟の一番上のボタンがいくつか外されている。\n-襟の両脇のボタンは銅とトパーズの飾りピンで留めてある。\n-アンダーシャツはノータック。\n-タンのダブルブレストのスーツジャケットをオーバーコートとして着用。\n-パンツはライトグレーのスラックス。パンツはブーツにタックイン。\n-ブーツは乗馬用のブーツで、フォーマルなブーツではないので、全体的な服装に合わせると奇妙に見えるかもしれない。\n\nオーバーコートの着用はオプション。また、シャツの襟、袖、裾の縁取りに銅の飾りをつけることもできる。\n\n別の者が犯した罪のせいで、不当に不死を強要され、すべてが変化し廃れていくのを見届けるのに費やした長い年月が彼を疲弊させた。無気力で退屈なことが多く、周囲の何事にも興味がない。比較的短期間で変化が見られるようなことには力を入れようとしないため、怠け者で自己中心的に見える。しばしば薬物や暴力的な戦闘に憂さ晴らしを求めようとする。努力は短時間にしかしない。\n\nお好きなように描いてください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CviyDhJIriTGHGyr728xtxTL52qUH73S", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muromachi/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2824027, "client_id": 1664051, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/370a772e/uploads/origins/bd838127-cab0-41ee-9c7d-4291201f8a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea945085ddd53bdc2be9d0cd4a1953c4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/370a772e/uploads/origins/bd838127-cab0-41ee-9c7d-4291201f8a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea945085ddd53bdc2be9d0cd4a1953c4, https://si.imgix.net/370a772e/uploads/origins/bd838127-cab0-41ee-9c7d-4291201f8a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b1be504d19f84f91ca67488306f22e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/370a772e/uploads/origins/bd838127-cab0-41ee-9c7d-4291201f8a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2338f01cedca67b15d9b929c5c1a76c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/370a772e/uploads/origins/bd838127-cab0-41ee-9c7d-4291201f8a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&